{"updated":"2026-11-22T03:06:59.980Z","versions":[{"id":"v3","name":"v3 (live)","note":"The model on the site today.","live":true,"leaky":false},{"id":"v3-gs","name":"v3, goals count as shots","note":"In \"no goals\", a goal still counts as the shot on goal it was, like SAT does. v3 drops it completely, which takes shots away from the team that scored.","live":false,"leaky":false},{"id":"v3-nopk","name":"v3, goals as shots, no kill credit","note":"A penalty killed off is only credited when the power play did not score, so it partly counts goals. This leaves it out.","live":false,"leaky":false},{"id":"v3-lean","name":"v3, shots and penalties only","note":"Drops faceoffs, hits, takeaways and giveaways.","live":false,"leaky":false},{"id":"v3-noen","name":"v3, empty net left out","note":"Pushes while a goalie is pulled do not count: the trailing team throws everything at the net then. A goalie is pulled because a team is losing, so its same-game number gets a small unfair boost.","live":false,"leaky":false},{"id":"v3-xg","name":"Shot quality (xG)","note":"Shots are worth their chance of going in (distance, angle, shot type) instead of a flat 1.0 with a home-plate bonus.","live":false,"leaky":false},{"id":"v3-pp","name":"v3, power-play shots 0.6x","note":"Power-play shots are easier to get; the penalty drawn already earned the credit.","live":false,"leaky":false},{"id":"v3-plate3","name":"v3, home plate 3x","note":"Shots from the home plate area (posts to dots to top of circles) count 3x instead of 1.5x.","live":false,"leaky":false},{"id":"v4","name":"v4 candidate","note":"Goals count as shots, faceoffs, hits, takeaways and giveaways left out, home plate shots 3x. Found by searching weights on 2021-24 and checked on 2024-26, where it beat v3 and SAT in every season.","live":false,"leaky":false},{"id":"v5","name":"v5 candidate","note":"v4, plus three things known before puck drop: shots count more for players who have finished above expected so far (shrunk hard toward average), and the next-game prediction adds the starting goalie's goals saved above expected and a back-to-back penalty. The goalie and back-to-back parts only affect \"Predicts next game\". Weights fit on 2021-24; 2024-25 on is the fair test.","live":false,"leaky":false},{"id":"v4-score","name":"v4, score-adjusted","note":"v4 with pushes by the leading team counted a little more (10% per goal of lead). Better at prediction, but uses the score, so not fair for the same-game test.","live":false,"leaky":true}],"seasons":{"20212022":{"v3":{"games":1312,"checks":{"pickNg":0.5129573170731707,"pickSat":0.5046801872074883,"pickMom":0.6993865030674846,"fitNg":0.7101522557986577,"fitSat":0.7217265366657504,"predNg":0.5957501311721191,"predSat":0.649474081245776,"aheadNg":0.594925634295713,"aheadSat":0.600174978127734,"halfPtsNg":0.5957501311721188,"halfPtsSat":0.6494740812457763,"halfGfNg":0.6009247595099445,"halfGfSat":0.6449468851361445,"aheadGdNg":0.2742491692061685,"aheadGdSat":0.27230092756833446}},"v3-gs":{"games":1312,"checks":{"pickNg":0.59375,"pickSat":0.5046801872074883,"pickMom":0.6993865030674846,"fitNg":0.780321320669313,"fitSat":0.7217265366657504,"predNg":0.6534737742305113,"predSat":0.649474081245776,"aheadNg":0.6141732283464567,"aheadSat":0.600174978127734,"halfPtsNg":0.6534737742305116,"halfPtsSat":0.6494740812457763,"halfGfNg":0.663261949386231,"halfGfSat":0.6449468851361445,"aheadGdNg":0.29128823942953747,"aheadGdSat":0.27230092756833446}},"v3-nopk":{"games":1312,"checks":{"pickNg":0.5653170359052712,"pickSat":0.5046801872074883,"pickMom":0.6687022900763359,"fitNg":0.7537851032474798,"fitSat":0.7217265366657504,"predNg":0.6298999727566739,"predSat":0.649474081245776,"aheadNg":0.6036745406824147,"aheadSat":0.600174978127734,"halfPtsNg":0.629899972756674,"halfPtsSat":0.6494740812457763,"halfGfNg":0.6382029131759146,"halfGfSat":0.6449468851361445,"aheadGdNg":0.28172932217158997,"aheadGdSat":0.27230092756833446}},"v3-lean":{"games":1312,"checks":{"pickNg":0.5940